#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:20
msgid ""
"The MSVC linker now passes its arguments through a response file when the "
"command line would exceed the Windows maximum length, fixing failures when "
"linking a large number of objects. (`#4177 <https://github.com/pypa/"
"setuptools/issues/4177>`_)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:21
msgid ""
"The Cygwin and MinGW compilers now pass ``-O1`` instead of a bare ``-O``. "
"The two are equivalent to GCC, but ``cc1`` rejected the bare form when "
"building 32-bit extensions with ``-m32``. -- by :user:`dchaudhari7177` "
"(`#4873 <https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/4873>`_)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:22
msgid ""
"``copy_file`` now preserves the full precision of the source's modification "
"time, so a copy is no longer considered older than its source on filesystems "
"with sub-second timestamp resolution. (`pypa/distutils#379 <https://github."
"com/pypa/distutils/issues/379>`_) (`#5079 <https://github.com/pypa/"
"setuptools/issues/5079>`_)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:23
msgid ""
"Setuptools wheels no longer bundled the project's own test modules. -- by :"
"user:`itscloud0` (`#5212 <https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5212>`_)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../NEWS (links).rst:24
msgid ""
"``build_ext`` no longer fails when cross-compiling with a compiler other "
"than MSVC (such as MinGW). ``Compiler`` now provides a no-op "
"``initialize()`` that non-MSVC compilers inherit. (`pypa/distutils#399 "
"<https://github.com/pypa/distutils/issues/399>`_)"
msgstr ""

